Tracking sequence

1. Customer clicks affiliate URL or scans QR code.
2. Tracking endpoint validates the referral.
3. System records the click and campaign attribution.
4. Consent and applicable privacy rules are checked.
5. First-party attribution is recorded where permitted.
6. Customer visits the store.
7. Customer completes an eligible purchase or subscription.
8. Store integration sends a verified conversion event.
9. Commission engine evaluates attribution and commission rules.
10. Commission is created as pending.
11. Order status, payment, cancellation, refund, and chargeback conditions are checked.
12. Eligible commission becomes approved.
13. Payout system processes the approved balance.
14. Payment provider response is recorded.
15. Payout is independently verified and shown in the affiliate portal.

Never create a paid commission simply because a click or browser redirect occurred.

